+ ## burdock

- - The cache of verified dependency JARs moves from `~/.cache/burdock/<sha256>.jar` to
-   `~/.cache/soundness/jars/<sha256>.jar` (under `$XDG_CACHE_HOME` instead of `~/.cache` where
-   the bootstrap honours it, as before). `burdock.Bootstrap.cacheDir()`, `externalize` and the
-   repackager all use the new location; nothing migrates an existing `~/.cache/burdock`, so
-   the first launch after upgrading re-downloads every requirement, and the old directory can be
-   deleted. (#2371)
